%% Cycle 2 — Authentification POST /api/auth/login
%% Export → public/ch4-mobile-auth.png

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Utilisateur
    participant APP as KodaMate (.NET MAUI)
    participant DS as Distributeur (FastAPI)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL (Supabase)

    U->>APP: Saisie email + mot de passe
    APP->>DS: POST /api/auth/login<br/>{emailclient, motdepasse}
    DS->>PG: SELECT authentification
    PG-->>DS: idproduit, idkoda, emailclient
    DS-->>APP: {status, data: {idproduit, emailclient, idkoda}}
    APP->>APP: Preferences.Set (session locale)
    APP-->>U: Navigation Accueil / Config robot

    Note over APP: Timeout 60 s · Base URL http://IP:8000/api
